+// Conventional circular restart arrow: a thick ring open across the top
+// with a solid arrowhead continuing the ring clockwise. The ring band is
+// stamped as tightly overlapping filled disks along the arc so it renders
+// as one solid, evenly weighted band. Centered on (x, y).
 void draw_restart_symbol(SDL_Renderer* r, int x, int y) {
-    circle(r, x, y, 29, {220, 237, 255, 255});
